In order for me to get the PCI adapter to be the X console, I needed to
disable the EISA adapter with the EISA config tools.  There was a
section in the release notes that talked about OSF4.0c having trouble
with multible X consoles.  Disabling the port worked.  Thanks to those
that responed.

